data
  title PACELC: the trade-off in every cell
  desc If Partition (PA/PC) choose A vs C — that is CAP. Else, normal operation (EL/EC), choose Latency vs C.
  compares
    - label PC — refuse stale, drop availability
    - label PA — serve stale, drop consistency
    - label EC — coordinate reads, pay latency
    - label EL — nearest replica, may be stale
